{"id": "official:sentence:2a9cce4f-ba52-4bec-b6b7-9803cf80d4d1", "text": "我的姐妹很苗条，我却有点超重。", "shortMeaning": "我姐妹身量纤细，我倒有点胖。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5e288ce4-d5ce-4e84-b1cf-718528827c22", "text": "我的姐妹总是把房间整理得很干净。", "shortMeaning": "我姐妹总把屋子拾得干净。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e7da8b54-b368-49fa-83bf-bacb8f1e9250", "text": "我的姐妹有一头齐肩发。", "shortMeaning": "我姐妹留着一头及肩的发。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:902ab61d-2da4-41c6-8997-b4692a42f36a", "text": "我的姐姐从事英语教学工作。", "shortMeaning": "我姐姐教英语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6320229a-a808-46d6-aa64-a37724d01b87", "text": "我的字典里没有这个词。", "shortMeaning": "这词我字典里查不到。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1033e22d-dee2-46ce-a084-f71f594c3901", "text": "我的字典非常有用。", "shortMeaning": "我的词典很好使。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6102494-e8c4-46ee-be0b-d64afa6d23cc", "text": "我的字迹难以辨别。", "shortMeaning": "我写的字难认。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:67b1e35a-0490-4c41-8df5-26abef990095", "text": "我的孙子现在八岁。", "shortMeaning": "我孙子今年八岁。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:9c9c0fc3-f652-49f4-9493-e7035681a1eb", "text": "我的孩子们喜欢甘草棒。", "shortMeaning": "我的孩子爱吃甘草糖棒。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d78f4e01-24ba-456d-b38b-ff81f5aab4c1", "text": "我的宝宝开始哭了，他想要吃奶。", "shortMeaning": "我家宝宝哭起来，是想吃奶了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:77704e6e-288f-4608-8465-639faa59e655", "text": "我的家与他的隔着一条江。", "shortMeaning": "我家跟他家隔着一条江。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:716362b2-24be-4488-96c4-34f6df234e8e", "text": "我的家乡非常漂亮。", "shortMeaning": "我老家很美。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c09ac070-ddc7-4194-8c31-9f95b7cc7604", "text": "我的家并不是那样的一个大家庭。", "shortMeaning": "我家并不是那样一大家子人。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a5656a47-8cba-4fa4-aee8-51165f8a4e5f", "text": "我的家庭为我很骄傲。", "shortMeaning": "我家人以我为荣。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1452442a-c6b7-4605-a378-407d8c6655da", "text": "我的家庭并不富有。", "shortMeaning": "我家并不宽裕。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:641bbbba-45ed-43b9-98aa-f128d527846e", "text": "我的家长想让我回家。", "shortMeaning": "我父母想叫我回家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a14de56b-6dbb-4f43-b18b-2758465a5add", "text": "我的寂寞是一条蛇。", "shortMeaning": "我的孤独像一条蛇。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d3aa0c4b-1191-424a-8663-6b3730651d8e", "text": "我的尿液是透明的。", "shortMeaning": "我的小便清亮无色。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:92ed1b61-72f3-4198-967f-fc2a7758c433", "text": "我的工资比他少多了。", "shortMeaning": "我的工资比他差一大截。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a138978f-d111-492f-a92f-2e3658f2e008", "text": "我的巧克力盒在哪里？", "shortMeaning": "我那盒巧克力在哪儿？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:13c1dc3e-13ce-41d6-90eb-59d304b17ddd", "text": "我的干衣服又湿了，因为突然下起雨了。", "shortMeaning": "忽然下起雨，我晾干的衣服又湿了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:fd8b234f-184b-418d-83a0-9458398e6671", "text": "我的年岁会露出来。", "shortMeaning": "我的岁数藏不住。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f4168ebe-571c-4000-adf3-b5b8ee7998d3", "text": "我的广东话比我的普通话好。", "shortMeaning": "我广东话比普通话强。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69fc286b-f99b-4eb8-8eaf-2b7fa6b66848", "text": "我的座位挨着你的座位。", "shortMeaning": "我的位子紧挨着你的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:016e2247-c623-4e82-b374-5ea5b6bdd605", "text": "我的弟弟总是抱着他的泰迪熊睡觉。", "shortMeaning": "我弟弟睡觉总搂着他的泰迪熊。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4df64616-0938-42f8-b58a-fae5c323678e", "text": "我的录像机可以拍高清视频。", "shortMeaning": "我的摄像机可以拍高清片。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0d658589-c954-41f3-8c9b-7018890e512b", "text": "我的影子不想跟我走。", "shortMeaning": "影子不肯随我走。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64a4bb30-4e03-443c-806a-80ea901f63fd", "text": "我的律师表哥现在在法国。", "shortMeaning": "我当律师的表哥如今在法国。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7a1fc4e4-4817-4b22-942c-845010a3504e", "text": "我的心七上八下的。", "shortMeaning": "我心里七上八下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b6bb200f-5de7-4d76-a192-0da1506c9292", "text": "我的心怦怦怦地跳。", "shortMeaning": "我的心咚咚直跳。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:12494dab-3a52-4bdb-acb5-e7c9e1d57587", "text": "我的心提到了嗓子眼上。", "shortMeaning": "我的心都提到嗓子眼了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f542f628-7c91-49fd-b9a3-ba5dbe6dc673", "text": "我的心是绿色和黄色的。", "shortMeaning": "我的心是绿的和黄的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:86359be5-5b5c-402b-af93-b1db6febdb07", "text": "我的心跳得那么快！", "shortMeaning": "我的心咚咚跳得飞快！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4ae08bcd-11e0-495d-8057-100f1178cda0", "text": "我的忍耐是有限的！", "shortMeaning": "我的耐性有限！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5ede6282-ce8b-4ad7-8388-75a9b5069f7c", "text": "我的怀疑没有根据。", "shortMeaning": "我这份疑心没有来由。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:93b1deed-331e-4e3d-abbd-098288cad0bc", "text": "我的想法与你不同。", "shortMeaning": "我的看法跟你不一样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0b4454ee-b059-4b6f-86aa-30d534e71efb", "text": "我的想法和你的不一样。", "shortMeaning": "我的主意跟你的不同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:900f82ec-86e8-4dc1-84b7-8156c4f3ed59", "text": "我的想法和你的不同。", "shortMeaning": "咱俩的想法有差别。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:221290d7-bd58-49a1-8edd-8739c3e46827", "text": "我的想法跟他的正好相反。", "shortMeaning": "我的主张跟他正相反。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5967faaf-6e19-4beb-bb54-0e3ea27a0422", "text": "我的意见和你的相反。", "shortMeaning": "我的意见跟你对着。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:02b52a85-1eb3-483a-9970-0b23cab53278", "text": "我的意见和您的完全不同。", "shortMeaning": "我的意见跟您截然不同。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:22a739d6-2123-4e87-b899-882031ebbbac", "text": "我的意见是，你该再次参加测试。", "shortMeaning": "我认为你该再去测一次。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:43e7644c-abb1-41f5-8f44-8bed3462feab", "text": "我的成功要归功于他。", "shortMeaning": "我能成，全仗着他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:14afc86f-0c92-4f42-8c98-3b4c6185aaac", "text": "我的房子外面有二十六只家畜。", "shortMeaning": "我家房子外头养着二十六头牲口。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6e08a344-9871-4282-b028-af06a6cdd608", "text": "我的房子就像你的。", "shortMeaning": "我的房子跟你那栋像。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8d950c60-0bea-4657-95ac-e08f1817092a", "text": "我的房子是木头做的。", "shortMeaning": "我的房子是木造的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1ff28f4-9100-47c0-b546-b58fbfe8d192", "text": "我的房子有两座楼梯。", "shortMeaning": "我这房子有两道楼梯。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f79bd8e9-f908-464f-b2d6-ae700f372ed6", "text": "我的房子绝对保险。", "shortMeaning": "我的房子绝对牢靠。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:45a22ff9-dac5-4717-abe4-35ac65951272", "text": "我的房里有部电话。", "shortMeaning": "我屋里有台电话。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04cb0bf4-7965-42cf-a210-a86899700afb", "text": "我的房间号是多少？", "shortMeaning": "我住几号房？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7ee5a011-7365-42f5-89a9-739a796dbc0c", "text": "我的房间欠了两个月租金。", "shortMeaning": "我这间房欠了两个月房租。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b3bf923a-b812-4eeb-8c04-15facbcd5897", "text": "我的房间比我的兄弟小。", "shortMeaning": "我的屋子比我兄弟那间小。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e995dc60-030a-4fb5-af09-be08606ebac6", "text": "我的房间里为什么有蟋蟀？", "shortMeaning": "我屋里怎么会有蟋蟀？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:df4f8bb1-e1d9-4530-abf1-8de5fa29e34f", "text": "我的房间里没有时钟。", "shortMeaning": "我屋里没钟。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e302b3a4-5b7f-418c-b9e4-431f5a9b33ba", "text": "我的手套尺寸是中号。", "shortMeaning": "我戴中号的手套。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:64ed5724-ade1-4e2e-8f58-086184af938e", "text": "我的手抖得太厉害，没法穿针了。", "shortMeaning": "我手抖得厉害，针都穿不进。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:70d19b20-2de3-41fa-bec3-b5b8d75b6061", "text": "我的手指冻僵了，以至于无法弹钢琴了。", "shortMeaning": "我手指冻僵，钢琴弹不动了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7fd3f09a-3b19-463a-a730-522c271eb029", "text": "我的手提包，一只是大的，另一只是中号的。", "shortMeaning": "我的手包一大一中。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:3fb5210c-b6b4-48d9-a9b0-7115a9f1b41f", "text": "我的手机不见了，怎么办？", "shortMeaning": "手机不见了，该咋办？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:83dbe974-2658-47f0-9092-6f99f9196c4b", "text": "我的手机充电器坏了。", "shortMeaning": "我的手机充电器不灵了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2bb6a7a2-9fc8-48fd-a2b7-58eec897af26", "text": "我的手机充电器掉了。", "shortMeaning": "我的充电器丢了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:65ad1525-9ddb-4e60-918a-7b708a0121a8", "text": "我的手机找到了，人家打电话来叫我去领了！", "shortMeaning": "手机找着了，有人来电叫我去取！", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:feee721e-ff04-405c-868d-24d16ad45e25", "text": "我的手止不住地颤抖。", "shortMeaning": "我的手抖个不停。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d9e34865-0184-4351-b363-91c35da055b4", "text": "我的手表跑哪去了？", "shortMeaning": "表怎么不见了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1247fbda-98b2-4551-a34b-d59f390aaf00", "text": "我的手表需要修理。", "shortMeaning": "我的表得修了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:79b68b5c-f61d-4cf7-a373-442d032d8ec5", "text": "我的手被熨斗烫了一下。", "shortMeaning": "我的手让熨斗烫了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:e057e0df-681b-4ab0-be51-67cbef2eb0d7", "text": "我的手被门夹到了。", "shortMeaning": "我的手让门夹了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8696ab0d-9216-4c4d-91cc-c4f71a2c220c", "text": "我的打字机故障了。", "shortMeaning": "我的打字机出毛病了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:983004e3-0eb9-4369-818f-0982d8c03857", "text": "我的护照被人偷了。", "shortMeaning": "我的护照叫人偷走了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:08d134ad-8af9-49a4-ba12-6156026f1ce8", "text": "我的文件夹去哪了？", "shortMeaning": "我的文件夹上哪儿去了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:939a3708-7072-48c7-a363-f6f03d178e85", "text": "我的新鞋子并不是很合脚。", "shortMeaning": "新鞋穿着不太跟脚。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:a1f23673-83d3-479c-a3ce-cb3002b53a26", "text": "我的朋友都不喝咖啡。", "shortMeaning": "我的朋友里头没一个喝咖啡。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:25221868-7525-4984-a676-db4a9855f207", "text": "我的木床实在很笨重。", "shortMeaning": "我那张木床沉得很。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:76191f71-4882-49ae-bf6d-3cb3129e1183", "text": "我的梦想是成为一名作家。", "shortMeaning": "我的愿望是当个作家。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:2537354a-ffa8-4727-9c3e-d4df02fe85f1", "text": "我的梦想是成为一名飞行员。", "shortMeaning": "我盼着当飞行员。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:05419ae8-84d8-4200-b3e2-bed9cfe0e90b", "text": "我的梦想是成为教授。", "shortMeaning": "我的愿望是当上教授。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:f01fb39f-b701-4cfa-baad-9c5fae8da0ed", "text": "我的梦想是生活在宁静的乡间。", "shortMeaning": "我盼着住到安静的乡下。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8415c684-a91d-48a5-adb6-0ef47a163408", "text": "我的梦想灰飞烟灭了。", "shortMeaning": "我的指望全成了泡影。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c78970a9-34eb-4fa8-8e94-7d778fbfa50d", "text": "我的梳子在哪里呢？", "shortMeaning": "我的梳子搁哪儿了？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:19914215-4ac1-46d6-8108-9442a712ef98", "text": "我的母亲从不早起来。", "shortMeaning": "我妈从不早起。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:dba60c4f-950e-452d-a3f9-cf7b644966f6", "text": "我的母亲只是默默地哭泣。", "shortMeaning": "我妈只是不声不响地哭。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:5f26405e-65ea-4f9c-b4a1-b8ebbe8394fb", "text": "我的母亲太累了，她早早地去睡了。", "shortMeaning": "我妈累坏了，很早便睡下了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:4bcb7565-a297-49d5-9f61-4edacfbe4213", "text": "我的母亲是一位天使，也是我的灵感来源。", "shortMeaning": "我妈像天使，也是我灵感的来处。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34f9adfc-bf22-4137-898a-8448f44b20c5", "text": "我的母亲经常被头痛困扰。", "shortMeaning": "我妈常闹头痛。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:7952c6a4-602b-41e6-890f-a21082527e66", "text": "我的母亲经常让行人吃耳光。", "shortMeaning": "我妈常给路人扇巴掌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d70a6703-736f-4d1b-969d-b3296a77c26d", "text": "我的母语是捷克语。", "shortMeaning": "捷克语是我的母语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:b8275d3f-f7e9-43e7-a76c-e38ac22f774a", "text": "我的母语是葡萄牙语。", "shortMeaning": "葡萄牙语是我的母语。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:1a9c588c-6ac0-471f-8b66-fd6f76527944", "text": "我的气垫船满是鳝鱼。", "shortMeaning": "我的气垫船上全是鳝鱼。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:c6ae6f2f-1ce5-4522-a5c5-8821308ba6ef", "text": "我的法语不是很好。", "shortMeaning": "我法语不怎么样。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:69eb2708-799a-47ff-8a47-1b58aba6ebcb", "text": "我的法语水平不高。", "shortMeaning": "我法语程度有限。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:d1cc04bd-7fb8-4869-9413-28d4c2c0b1dc", "text": "我的洗衣机发出怪声。", "shortMeaning": "我的洗衣机响得怪。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:34af2ef9-be65-44c0-9a0c-a6e2d1af94c5", "text": "我的涂改液用完了，现在写字只用铅笔。", "shortMeaning": "修正液用光了，如今写字只用铅笔。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:0e77b862-c16f-4bba-9f18-e2caff735b5d", "text": "我的消息对年轻人很重要。", "shortMeaning": "我这条消息对青年人很要紧。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:ad139ab9-a22d-4ef5-ad56-08e51f8755d0", "text": "我的演讲稿就是依据这个理论写的。", "shortMeaning": "我的发言稿是按这套理论写的。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:beca1256-6489-438e-8573-1bf494141e23", "text": "我的热水瓶被人偷了。", "shortMeaning": "我的暖壶让人偷了。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6112602a-4dc4-433b-97e9-5d57230624e3", "text": "我的照相机是尼康的。", "shortMeaning": "我的相机是尼康牌。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:8580b929-e696-4b01-9405-e398c433a1bf", "text": "我的照相机是防水的。", "shortMeaning": "我的相机能防水。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:cea3044f-e665-463f-8a7d-71bdc56bee90", "text": "我的爱好不但广泛而且有用。", "shortMeaning": "我的喜好又杂又实用。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:04adfe46-339a-4b3e-9218-627d48ac94b9", "text": "我的爱好为我的生活带来什么？", "shortMeaning": "我的爱好给日子添了什么？", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
{"id": "official:sentence:6fa94c18-09c1-41a6-a32b-967396062641", "text": "我的爱好是开车和弹吉他。", "shortMeaning": "我喜欢开车，也爱拨吉他。", "authoredOn": "2026-10-24"}
